{'symbol': 'AXP', 'date': '2022-02-04 13:44:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN EXPRESS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER TO PARTICIPATE IN KBW FINTECH PAYMENTS CONFERENCE', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY (NYSE: AXP) VICE CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER JEFFREY C. CAMPBELL WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE KEEFE, BRUYETTE & WOODS (KBW) FINTECH PAYMENTS CONFERENCE IN NEW YORK ON THURSDAY, MARCH 3, AT 8:45 A.M. EST. MR. CAMPBELL WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT RELATING TO THE COMPANY'S BUSINESS STRATEGY AND FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE. A LIVE AUDIO WEBCAST WILL BE ACCESSIBLE TO THE GENERAL PUBLIC THROUGH THE AMERICAN EXPRESS INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSI"}